    Draw Number ClipSampleRate At PanelText + 58, ANIMATION_DETAILS_Y + 20 Size 11 Color CYAN
    Draw Number ClipSampleCount At PanelText + 104, ANIMATION_DETAILS_Y + 20 Size 11 Color WHITE
    Draw Number ClipEventCount At PanelText + 166, ANIMATION_DETAILS_Y + 20 Size 11 Color YELLOW
    Draw Text "Model clips / sockets / events" At PanelText, ANIMATION_DETAILS_Y + 42 Size 11 Color LIGHT_GRAY
    Draw Number ModelClipCount At PanelText, ANIMATION_DETAILS_Y + 62 Size 11 Color WHITE
    Draw Number ModelSocketCount At PanelText + 58, ANIMATION_DETAILS_Y + 62 Size 11 Color CYAN
    Draw Number ModelEventCount At PanelText + 116, ANIMATION_DETAILS_Y + 62 Size 11 Color YELLOW

End Sub

